### Reprogramar jobs visibles (con JB016) — resultado esperado (200, affectedJobs)
# Fechas en la hora local de quien consulta; los jobs quedan Programados.
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [51021],
  "startDate": "2026-11-24T08:00:00",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-24T10:00:00"
}

### Fecha límite antes del inicio → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [51021],
  "startDate": "2026-11-24T10:00:00",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-24T08:00:00"
}

### Agente con un job de otra persona → 400 "No tiene acceso a uno o más jobs"
POST {{baseUrl}}/Jobs/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAgent}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobIds": [51021],
  "startDate": "2026-11-24T08:00:00",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-24T10:00:00"
}
